+  - **`[R]` refactor** — align both to a shared shape, then formalize.
+  - **`[A]` accept-with-rationale** — catalog in `KB § PATTERNS/accept-with-rationale.md` if absorption cost > marginal duplication cost (e.g. trivial files ≤5 lines that genuinely vary per product).
+- **N≥3 ⇒ MUST formalize.** Silently shipping the 4th instance is forbidden. Minimum response when blocked: file a follow-up `seed-absorb-<short-name>` project; do not silently absorb seed-build into consumer scope.
